APPROVED by coordinator: the scratch-symbol-table deviation. Omitted files' own
NON-COLLIDING declarations are added to a scratch table (file_ids past the end of
the snapshot, alive for one function, never seen by the join) so their bodies
RESOLVE - without that, a generated subclass calling an inherited member records
nothing and the FP survives. The collision filter is load-bearing: skipping any
decl the pooled table already has means a whole-tree copy contributes nothing and
resolves against the originals, which is what keeps refuted-alternative-1's
duplicate-declaration defect from reappearing.

